{
  "slug": "our-mission",
  "title": "Our Mission",
  "subtitle": "",
  "body": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 9pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Utah View exists to make global news accessible, clear, and worth your time.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 9pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We cover every major region — the Americas, Europe, Asia-Pacific, the Middle East, and Africa — with monthly briefings that cut through the noise. Our goal is simple: give readers a reliable picture of what’s happening in the world without the spin, the clickbait, or the overwhelming volume of a 24-hour news cycle.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:5pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#121212;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What We Believe</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 9pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Good journalism doesn’t require complexity. The most important stories in the world can be told plainly, with context that helps readers understand not just what happened, but why it matters.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 9pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We believe every reader deserves access to global news — not just those who follow foreign policy for a living. Whether it’s a shifting trade relationship, an election halfway around the world, or a humanitarian crisis that isn’t making headlines, we cover it with the same standard: accuracy, context, and respect for your attention.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:5pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#121212;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">How We Work</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 9pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Each month, we publish briefings across our regional beats, alongside analysis, opinion, and data-driven pieces that go deeper. We aim to be the one source you can read cover to cover and come away genuinely informed about the state of the world.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 9pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Utah View is independent and reader-supported. We don’t answer to advertisers or algorithms — just to the standard of getting it right.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:5pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#121212;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What We Offer</span></h3><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Utah View is a free, publicly accessible news site delivering monthly briefings on global politics across every major region. No login is required to read any published content.</span></h3><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Users can sign in with their Google account to access additional features, including subscribing to our email newsletter and saving stories to read later. Google sign-in is used solely for authentication — we do not access or store any information from your Google account beyond what is needed to identify you and deliver these features.</span></h3><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:8pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#121212;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">How We Use Your Data</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 9pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">When you subscribe to our newsletter, we collect your email address solely to deliver our monthly briefings. If you create an account to save stories, we store basic account information to provide that feature. We do not sell or share your personal data with third parties for marketing purposes.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 9pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">For full details, see our </span><a href=\"https://theutahview.com/page?p=Privacy-Policy\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#1155cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Privacy Policy</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></p><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-934af223-7fff-392d-6ae5-da357435f0c4\"><br></span></p>",
